flowchart TD
    Start([START: Flow Start\nflow: autolaunched\nvariable: flag Boolean])
    Assign[ASSIGNMENT: Set Flag\nset: flag = true]
    Decision{DECISION: Check Flag}
    End1([END: Success])
    End2([END: Failure])
    Start --> Assign
    Assign --> Decision
    Decision -->|Yes if flag = true| End1
    Decision -->|No default| End2
